  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Geothermal Power Generation Project (Second Additional Financing)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project supports the construction and commissioning of 110 megawatts (MW) of geothermal electricity net generating capacity in West Java (Patuha Unit 2). This project will provide a reliable and sustainable source of electricity in Indonesia. The second additional financing will only fund cost overruns without changing the scope of the project.</narrative>
  </description>
